{%- comment -%}
  Per-collection editorial copy (single source of truth, moved here from the
  retired collection-hero-tabs section so the PLP can use it both above the
  grid — the one-line intro — and below it — the editorial lead).

  Usage:  {%- capture x -%}{%- render 'collection-copy', part: 'tagline' -%}{%- endcapture -%}
  part:   handle      → content key for the cht-* snippets (sacred-essentials-* map to their base gem)
          welcome     → "Welcome to the World of …" name
          tagline     → one-line poetic tagline
          description → English description; paragraphs separated by "||"
          hindi       → Hindi strapline as inline HTML (<strong>…</strong><br>…), blank if none
          benefits    → three tick lines separated by "\n" (literal backslash-n, split by the caller)
          planet      → ruling planet phrase for the hero eyebrow ("Chandra, the Moon"); only gems the
                        planet-summary snippet lists, blank otherwise
{%- endcomment -%}

